                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1c405482-4971-3a92-82d6-d3d96f50246b",
                        "entry_id": "827c6fa1-b644-390a-ab77-be53d5cf1023",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To give new life, energy or strength to someone or something; to revitalize."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fc38591-6fff-4252-bd58-323af03ebdab",
                                "sense_id": "1c405482-4971-3a92-82d6-d3d96f50246b",
                                "text": "The attraction that it exerts on the millions that stroll through its maze of information might be used to reinvigorate our cities. Cyberflaneurs have become captivated with the Internet's ready supply of huge amounts of information..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78e35a41-f719-47bf-8c88-4f2cb1298a97",
                                "sense_id": "1c405482-4971-3a92-82d6-d3d96f50246b",
                                "text": "Dynamic typography reinvigorates the storytelling genre by anthropomorphizing fonts, defibrillating calligraphy, creating rhythmic, ambient moodscapes without sacrificing speed or lushness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7cc60c5-4e9c-45a7-8239-8a546b46f546",
                                "sense_id": "1c405482-4971-3a92-82d6-d3d96f50246b",
                                "text": "And it's probably not a coincidence that the time they evoke was also the beginning of the heyday of Asian commercial cinema, when directors like Tsui Hark and John Woo were reinvigorating moribund movie genres with wild kineticism and an almost insolent indifference to the niceties of narrative logic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e59c66bb-e15b-4fce-95b0-8572e1aaa03e",
                                "sense_id": "1c405482-4971-3a92-82d6-d3d96f50246b",
                                "text": "Mr. Putin has reinvigorated an alliance that spent years confused about its purpose once it lost the adversary it was formed to contain, the Soviet Union. Now, containment is back."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "710cb55f-ed15-4f97-9f1f-22cb2f78b8bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "827c6fa1-b644-390a-ab77-be53d5cf1023",
                        "source_sense_id": "1c405482-4971-3a92-82d6-d3d96f50246b",
